dsh-acp-pro
===========

Third-party components
----------------------

- Agent Client Protocol SDK (`@agentclientprotocol/sdk`), Apache-2.0, see the
  package for its license text.
- The DeepSeek Harness packages (`@deepseek-ai/*`) used at build time and as
  runtime peers remain under their own licenses and are not vendored here.

Maintenance note
----------------

This plugin depends on DSH's plugin-record API (`appendPluginRecord`). DSH
documents that API for packages under `packages/experimental/`; it is not an
official stability promise for external plugins, so DSH upgrades may require
follow-up changes in this repository.

